+/*
+ * The cpu_state should be set to CPU_UP_PREPARE in kick_cpu(), otherwise
+ * the cpu_state is always CPU_DEAD after calling generic_set_cpu_dead(),
+ * which makes the delay in generic_cpu_die() not happen.
